{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118086","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118086/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118086/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118086/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118086","id":4189649483,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7PXvFu","number":118086,"title":"Remove reference bump of instance during GDScript function calls","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":955079684,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw5NTUwNzk2ODQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/breaks%20compat","name":"breaks compat","color":"b64245","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1007033697,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMDA3MDMzNjk3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/salvageable","name":"salvageable","color":"ff7766","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-04-01T20:23:21Z","updated_at":"2026-07-01T07:53:29Z","closed_at":"2026-04-18T17:03:10Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118086","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118086","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118086.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118086.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"> [!NOTE]\r\n> The diff here looks worse than it is at first glance, due to some refactoring I threw in. I've split this into three commits to separate the adding of the `_script_error_debug_break` method and unit test change. Look at the middle commit for the actually relevant part of this.\r\n\r\nThis is the half of #117850 that got removed at the last minute due to being a breaking change, and arguably being a more controversial change as well. I figured I should put it up for the sake of discussion at least.\r\n\r\nThis changes the `Variant` at `stack[ADDR_STACK_SELF]` in `GDScriptFunction::call` to not increment the reference counter of the `GDScriptInstance::owner`, using `VariantInternal::object_assign_without_ref_unsafe`, similar to how #117850 did the same for `stack[ADDR_STACK_CLASS]`.\r\n\r\nIn a real-world project that makes heavy use of `RefCounted` GDScript classes this change nets about as much performance as #117850 did, meaning a few percentage points off the total runtime of a recorded replay:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"419\" height=\"41\" alt=\"Before\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fe84d705-a527-4603-9ea4-ae4ff6e31bea\" />\r\n<img width=\"415\" height=\"42\" alt=\"After\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/522ad9ca-e2c5-4325-b67e-562aa514a1a5\" />\r\n\r\nHowever, as mentioned, this is technically a breaking change, as GDScript currently allows you to remove the last reference of a `RefCounted` object while a method is being called on it. To me, this seems like a questionable use-case though, and perhaps something that might be better off reported to the user as a bug to begin with.\r\n\r\nI've added this reporting in the form of a local `Ref<RefCounted>`, specifically for `DEBUG_ENABLED` builds (i.e. editor and debug templates), which is used to check if all other references are gone by the end of `GDScriptFunction::call`, and if that's the case then it will simply cause an error and a debugger break, much like a null access would.\r\n\r\nNote that since this reporting is `DEBUG_ENABLED`-only, release templates will have no such safe guard and will instead (depending on the application) result in a use-after-free memory access, which can corrupt memory and/or crash the application.","closed_by":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118086/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118086/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}